        "title": "Smart Cities and Urban Technology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "\"Smart city\" is a contested term. It ranges from IBM's 2010s \"instrument everything\" marketing to bottom-up civic tech. The useful framing: technology applied to urban systems to improve efficiency, service delivery, equity, and sustainability — with the city as a complex adaptive system, not a machine to be optimized."
